Z||000000||Turkey on Rye||10-28-2001||06:50 PM||||ok everyone, i got this weird thing going on with my car and its driving me NUTS! When i am stoped, my car has a crazy idle going on. It surges from 900 to 1300 rpm constantly. It pulsates and its makin me mad cause i cant figure out whats going on. Timing? Some help me, i'm about to go crazy.||||reg||1
Z||000001||Fierozilla||10-28-2001||06:56 PM||||Is it throwing a code? In drive, at idle, it show fluxuate between roughly 700-750 rpms (on autos). In park/neutral, it should flux between 900-950 rpms.<BR>Im not entirely sure what the prob w/ your car is; however, I know there have been lots of posts on here regarding the same thing. If you're getting a code, that should help. If not, hmmm...dunno. Somebody on here knows though; like I said, Ive seen this same question on here lots of times before.<BR>(IAC maybe?)||||reg||1
