Z||000003||theogre||10-28-2001||08:40 PM||||read the stuff in the wire service article in my cave. Screwed up wiring and charging system problems can cause exactly this problem. (GM even published a TSB about it but I forget the number right now.)<P>after that check for vacuum problems. Then think about sensor issues etc.<P>------------------<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/fullstaff.gif">  <FONT COLOR="blue"><I><B>11-Sept-01, The day the world as we knew it ended.</B></I></FONT>||||reg||1
